OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786542495
OL,3,CPolice probe report of shots fired at
OL,4,Chouse in Lisburn
OL,6,FPolice are investigating a report of
OL,7,Fshots being fired at a house in
OL,8,FLisburn.
OL,10,FA car was also damaged in the incident
OL,11,Fin the Breton Court area in the early
OL,12,Fhours of Tuesday.
OL,14,FNo-one was injured.
OL,16,FA police spokesperson said they
OL,17,Freceived a report that a number of
OL,18,Fshots had been fired at the house
OL,19,Fshortly before 1.30am on Tuesday.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/3
