OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786542495
OL,3,CPolice probe report of shots fired at
OL,4,Chouse in Lisburn
OL,6,F"The shots were fired at the front
OL,7,Fdoor and an upstairs window causing
OL,8,Fdamage but thankfully, those present
OL,9,Fin the property at the time were
OL,10,Funinjured," they said.
OL,12,F"A car parked at the house was also
OL,13,Fdamaged during the incident.
OL,15,F"We are working to establish a motive
OL,16,Ffor the attack and are asking anyone
OL,17,Fwho may have information, or relevant
OL,18,Fdash-cam, CCTV or doorbell footage
OL,19,Fwhich could assist with our enquiries,
OL,20,Fto contact us in Lisburn on 101,
OL,21,Fquoting reference 64 11/08/26."
